{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23914","headline":"赠僧五首 鉢塔院如大师 · 白居易","name":"赠僧五首 鉢塔院如大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百千万劫菩提种，八十三年功德林。\n若不秉持僧行苦，将何报答佛恩深。\n慈悲不瞬诸天眼，清净无尘几地心。\n每岁八关蒙九授，殷懃一戒重千金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}